{c: Verse 1}
[Em]Auni pauni [Am]teri harqaton [D]pe khulke [Em]hansta hua
[Em]Aadhi tedhi [Am]teri aahaton [D]pe aahein [Em]bharta hua
[Em]Pehle [Am]to sensible [D]sa yeh [Am]mera deewana [Em]dil tha
[Em]Kya isko [Am]ho gaya, naa [D]jaane kya hua
[Em]Sochta hoon [Am]raat bhar
